# Real secrets never enter the repository; only .env.example is tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# openapi.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is generated, but it is also the
# contract other people read, and `checkOpenApiDrift` compares the committed copy
# against what the code produces. Ignoring it would make that check fail on a
# fresh clone with "no spec found" — and, worse, leave nothing for a consumer to
# read.

# The frontend build, copied here so the server can serve it from one origin.
